Dong, where does it 'complain'?

One thing you can do is set the checkChipType flag to FALSE, for
example:

cs <- AffymetrixCelSet$fromName("my_data", chipType="my_chip",
checkChipType=FALSE)

 From what I remember, if this is set to TRUE, then it reads the
header and does a check.  Otherwsie, it doesn't.

Hope that helps.
Mark

