session and do:

library(affxparser);
path <- "rawData/myDataSet/HG-U133A";
pathnames <- file.path(path, c("GSM123182.cel", "GSM123184.cel"));
hdrs <- lapply(pathnames, FUN=readCelHeader);
chipTypes <- sapply(hdrs, FUN=.subset2, "chiptype");
print(chipTypes);

What does that return?  If something strange, let me know what
print(hdrs) returns.

