Subject: Re: [aroma.affymetrix] Re: Analyzing copy number in cancer samples
Message-ID: <9VTB0jj0Gdo.jC5OUvqjnQoJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <9VTB0jj0Gdo.cjCGjFFXHbUJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
